krouter — Author

  Kage

History (short):
  From about 2004 I kept expanding firewall and iptables-based routing work
  (home labs and many other setups). A recognizable home-router shape grew
  around 2006. Years of upgrades led to today's krouter.

  Real household production use (not just experiments) started around
  July 2025: krouter as the main gateway, the old router moved to AP mode,
  and several AP-mode APs around the house — still in daily use.
